    "canonical_ref": "AlexHier.Ep.IV.1.s1",
    "language": "eng",
    "text": "And he—i.e., Demetrius—has added to his letter that this is a matter that was never heard of before, and has never been done now,—namely,",
    "chunk_index": 16,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 225,
    "date_range": [
      212,
      250
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "anf-works/alexander-of-jerusalem-epistles#AlexHier.Ep.IV.1.s2",
    "work_id": "anf-works/alexander-of-jerusalem-epistles",
    "canonical_ref": "AlexHier.Ep.IV.1.s2",
    "language": "eng",
    "text": "that laymen should take part in public speaking, when there are bishops present. But in this assertion he has departed evidently far from the truth by some means.",
    "chunk_index": 17,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 225,
    "date_range": [
      212,
      250
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
