    "work_id": "anf-works/alexander-of-jerusalem-epistles",
    "canonical_ref": "AlexHier.Ep.IV.1.s3",
    "language": "eng",
    "text": "For, indeed, wherever there are found persons capable of profiting the brethren, such persons are exhorted by the holy bishops to address the people.",
    "chunk_index": 18,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 225,
    "date_range": [
      212,
      250
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "anf-works/alexander-of-jerusalem-epistles#AlexHier.Ep.IV.1.s4",
    "work_id": "anf-works/alexander-of-jerusalem-epistles",
    "canonical_ref": "AlexHier.Ep.IV.1.s4",
    "language": "eng",
    "text": "Such was the case at Laranda, where Evelpis was thus exhorted by Neon; and at Iconium, Paulinus was thus exhorted by Celsus;",
    "chunk_index": 19,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 225,
    "date_range": [
      212,
      250
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "anf-works/alexander-of-jerusalem-epistles#AlexHier.Ep.IV.1.s5",
    "work_id": "anf-works/alexander-of-jerusalem-epistles",
    "canonical_ref": "AlexHier.Ep.IV.1.s5",
    "language": "eng",
    "text": "and at Synada, Theodorus also by Atticus, our blessed brethren. And it is probable that this is done in other places also, although we know not the fact.",
